  "story.bonus": "{n} credits for the talk",
  "story.channel": "channel 7",
  "story.cocky": "Everyone says that until their first boulevard in the snow. Fine, short version: handbrake to slide, gas to hold the angle, wheel straight to exit. Nitro builds up from drifts, jumps and overtakes.",
  "story.cocky.c0": "Got it. What's next?",
  "story.cocky.c1": "Tell me more anyway.",
  "story.garage": "You got a Kestrel S2 — a car from the noughties. Weak from the factory, but it opens up with tuning better than the new ones. Parts cost credits, the class grows from D to S. Credits come from races and records.",
  "story.garage.c0": "Where do I get credits right now?",
  "story.garage.c1": "And the rating?",
  "story.hello": "Channel clear? Good. I'm the Dispatcher. Forty minutes ago you asked for access to the night races. The city doesn't forgive those who drive blind, so listen to me for a couple of minutes.",
  "story.hello.c0": "I'm listening.",
  "story.hello.c1": "I know all this already.",
  "story.login": "Log in to grab the starter bonus",
  "story.rating": "Rating goes by car class and by season. Open online races with two people or more count. Time records are a separate table, and nobody gets in without a race recording.",
  "story.rating.c0": "Got it. Credits?",
  "story.reward": "Here's your starter bonus — five thousand for your first part. Tip: start with tires. And remember — the city is yours at night until you make a mistake in it. Over.",
  "story.reward.c0": "Over and out.",
  "story.rules": "Three rules. One: don't jerk the wheel in a slide — hold it into the turn, the car will catch the angle. Two: the walls are soft, but a hit burns your drift chain. Three: lost? Hit R and we'll put you back on track.",
  "story.rules.c0": "Clear.",
